# Facts about Headmistress Isolde Marrow.

@fact isolde.names
tier: surface
text: She remembers every student's name, and every student's mistakes.

@fact isolde.portrait
tier: secret
hint: Look for the corridor nobody uses.
unlock: seen(isolde_portrait) > 0
text: As a student she set the observatory on fire twice. Her portrait from those days is hidden in a forgotten corridor.

@fact isolde.chess
tier: personal
hint: Visit her tower when she's at her window.
unlock: seen(isolde_chess) > 0
text: She plays tower chess by her window and laughs, short and delighted, when she loses.

@fact isolde.thread
tier: secret
hint: She is following something too.
unlock: flag(warden_trial) or seen(hs_isolde_summons) > 0
text: She has been following the same thread you have: the seal beneath the lake is weakening.

@fact isolde.mercy
tier: personal
hint: Ask her what she thinks is just.
unlock: seen(isolde_judgement) > 0
text: She asks students what they think is just, and sometimes she listens.

@fact isolde.vrell
tier: personal
hint: An old name is crossed out in the academy's ledger.
unlock: seen(item_grimoire_isolde) > 0
text: She knows the name Absalom Vrell: expelled long before her time, and still in the ledger, crossed out.

@fact isolde.really
tier: personal
hint: Take tea with her in her tower.
unlock: seen(headmistress_tower_tea) > 0
text: She asks how your term is going, and then how it is really going, and waits for the second answer.
